[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Englund Gambit"]
[Variation "Englund Gambit: Main Line, Bc3 trap"]
[ECO "A40"]
[Character "tactical,gambit"]
[Risk "high"]
[EarlyMate "black"]
[Tricks "trap,pin"]
[Themes "pin-on-c3,back-rank"]
[For "white"]
[Kind "against-us"]
[Opponent "5...Qxb2"]
[Start "1. d4 e5 2. dxe5 Nc6 3. Nf3 Qe7 4. Bf4 Qb4+ 5. Bd2 Qxb2"]

6. Bc3 $2 { It hits the queen, so it looks natural, but it walks into a pin. } 6... Bb4 { Pins the bishop on c3 to the king, since the king on e1 stands behind it. White is lost: Bd2 drops the rook on a1, and Qd2 is worse. } 7. Qd2 $4 { Tries to meet the pin, but the bishop simply takes. } 7... Bxc3 8. Qxc3 $4 { Leaves the first rank open. } 8... Qc1# *
